Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第13人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.57,0:02:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,溜進去容易,帶個奴隸出來就難了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對表
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.71,0:03:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,9點行動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,9點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King好像是關在地牢裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那個了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King先生!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King先生, 你在嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個, 你知道有個叫"King"的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.89,0:04:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,誰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們為什麼在找King
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因為是朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們來救他脫獄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:05:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,騙人, King不認識你們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算如此, 看來你知道他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我聽說King有個母同伴, 看來是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.13,0:05:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King現在在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你是誰,但King不會拋下我一個人走的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra, 我找到地牢的開關了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是電子開關
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能打開嗎, 7
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是專門開金庫的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.59,0:05:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真令人作嘔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐,我要弄你出來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之後,請帶我到King那
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.79,0:05:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不叫小姐,我是 Ellis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.61,0:05:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,開錯門了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zora星人死了就會消失
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,23號, 22號
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.73,0:06:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藏起來, 他們在巡視
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看守來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麻煩了, 少一個囚犯, 很可疑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:07:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦, Cobra?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.30,0:07:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,18號!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,17號!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,16號!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,11號...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,11號, 怎麼了, 11號
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我聽到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.27,0:07:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我聽力很好,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,11號,出來, 有比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比賽?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比賽指什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藍色, Guldo星人!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沙漠地獄來的大力士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.35,0:08:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,紅色的,初登場, Zora星人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.23,0:08:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個奴隸不是Zora星人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是地球人,我們有這種奴隸?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼不好,地球人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偶爾看看地球人的紅血液不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比賽開始
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我雖和你毫無冤仇,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼能力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他居然是來自地球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個撿到寶了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.51,0:09:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,殺死他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已經戰鬥不能了, 沒有必要殺死他了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,處理掉失敗者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是下個對手會更強
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能贏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藍色角落,Gizla的英雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,無敵的角鬥士, King!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是能量視覺角鬥場
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.78,0:10:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能看到2位鬥士的光環碰撞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.39,0:10:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這有的看了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一個有潛在恐怖能力的地球人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一個是無敵的格鬥家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我會給這個勝利的奴隸自由
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.10,0:11:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了,大家,坐好, 終極戰鬥要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都hi了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還有10min
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前,讓我好好享受下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比賽開始
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真失望
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zaru, 按約定,給我自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他壓根沒想過
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.57,0:12:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到死都是他的戰鬥玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,熱身就到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.45,0:12:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本篇該開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.23,0:13:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等,我是來帶你出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,納尼, 為了啥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為了奪取 Shiva城堡.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shiva 城堡?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以相信你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.47,0:13:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是否, 你就一直在這當奴隸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.41,0:13:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的,我相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是怎麼才能從這逃出去?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,馬上我的仲間就會製造混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到時別鬆手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.81,0:13:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這2人的高速,都看不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.45,0:14:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,誰會贏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,9點
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.87,0:14:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,該放煙花了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就現在,King, 逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就那
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.45,0:16:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2人閃開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.67,0:16:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cobra! 這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這有逃生路線
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,派對結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行動了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King! 快,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地牢深處有個秘密出口
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別讓他們跑了,給我追
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是...潛水艇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快,打開它
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.99,0:17:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來了,快上去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,8，你幹嘛,快過來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你還在玩什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下, 就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們, 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到牢裡去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奴隸商人的下場
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.11,0:18:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了, King.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們開往哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.37,0:18:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是應該知道進入城堡路的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,城堡漂浮在湖上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有條地下水道通往湖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能進入那個水道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就能到達Shiva城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shiva 城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.86,0:19:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們原來是想去那
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那裡現在是混沌軍的總部
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.55,0:19:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從混沌軍手裡奪回Shiva城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收復?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收復, 笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.97,0:19:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就我們, 王國的拯救者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看那女人, 殺手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起來就像出生高跟裡就有機槍了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搶銀行的和他馬子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.15,0:19:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還有個重金懸賞的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加上我,爆炸專家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.73,0:19:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還真是正義之師啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.61,0:19:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老實說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這裡所有人都是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為了城堡的財寶而來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.59,0:20:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們滿腦袋都是那應該藏在Shiva城堡的一座山裡的財寶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shiva城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有那麼近
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不對,那是蜃氣樓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.81,0:20:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的Shiva城堡藏的很遠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shiva城堡用這種方式迎接來訪者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前是美景, 現在是恐怖的麻婆羅西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jack, 正如你所說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們是被選中的,這個計劃的委託人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.77,0:21:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,計算過我們各自的才能才把各人找來的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.71,0:21:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為了得到財寶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.75,0:21:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,殺掉似乎並, 炸開牆壁, 敲開金庫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.37,0:21:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, Cobra... 那你的才能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.31,0:21:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼選你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.35,0:21:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因為我曾去過一次那個城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.89,0:23:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們終於從地下水道到達Shiva城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.86,0:23:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是入口被封鎖了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.38,0:23:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要打開它,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.73,0:23:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了扮成混沌士兵混進去,別無他法
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.28,0:23:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,費了9牛2虎之力進去的我們,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.44,0:23:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遇到一個正進行的可疑儀式
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.76,0:23:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這幫傢伙在這到底在幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.66,0:23:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下集Cobra動畫: 神殿的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夜露死苦
